[[2047,127,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow security regulations prescribed\n(see 5040A - Warnings).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Drain the coolant. \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p><p>1. Unscrew.</p><p>2. Move the power steering fluid cup.</p><p>3. Unscrew.</p><p>4. Disconnect the unions (4a) and take the  bush (4b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Plug the disconnected unions to\nprevent humidity and dirt from entering the system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018482.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,16,"<p>1. While operating under the dashboard, unscrew the air conditioner\nassembly link.</p><p>2. Remove the link.</p><p>3. Unscrew the expansion valve lid.</p><p>4. Remove the lid.</p><p>5. Unscrew (5a) and take the plate (5b).</p><p>6. Remove the union.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018483.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the component is intact.</p><p>Reposition the union.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the union O-rings.</p><p>Use\ngreen R134A coolantproof rings only.</p><p>Lubricate union threads\nwith antifreezing oil.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Reposition the plate and screw it.</p><p>Fasten the expansion spring lid with its\nscrews.</p><p>Reposition the air conditioner link and\nscrew it.</p><p>Reposition the bush, connect the unions\nand screw them.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>Evaporator connector</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9 - 1.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Position the power steering fluid cup and\nscrew it.</p><p>Rload the coolant.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p>"]]